   ],
   "headline": "MCP moves to two specification releases a year",
   "summary": "Spec versions now ship on a six-month schedule, generally the last Tuesday of March and September. The next release is planned for March 30, 2027 as version 2027-03-30. The maintainers say existing clients and servers need no changes because of this announcement.",
   "curriculum_note": "Pin MCP labs to the spec version the SDKs target today, and put a lab refresh on the calendar for April 2027.",
   "details": [
    "Planning for each release starts eight months ahead, with proposal deadlines and SDK beta dates published in advance.",
    "The change affects how releases are prepared, not MCP messages or version negotiation."
   ],
