   "headline": "OpenAI sets February shutdowns for gpt-image-2 and the cyber preview model",
   "summary": "gpt-image-2 and gpt-image-2-2026-04-21 shut down on Feb 10, 2027, with gpt-image-2.6-sunburst or gpt-image-2.6-flare as replacements. gpt-5.5-cyber-preview is removed on Feb 1, 2027.",
